1. Choose page: "Learn what Healthy Housing and Vector Control can inspect" (\`scopeInfo\` → /sf.gov/information/learn-what-hhvc-can-inspect)
2. Choose page: "Health Code Article 11 in plain language" (\`article11Guide\` → /sf.gov/report/health-code-article-11-plain-language)
3. Choose page: "Integrated pest management for property owners and managers" (\`ownerGuidance\` → /sf.gov/information/integrated-pest-management-for-property-owners-and-managers)
4. Choose page: "Mosquito Control Program" (\`mosquitoControl\` → /sf.gov/mosquito-control-program)

