### Things to Know — \`things_to_know\` [TYPE] — page not approved

**Block 1 — Title:**

Who this information is for

**Block 1 — Text:**

An owner, manager, or tenant named on a Healthy Housing and Vector Control Notice of Violation who disagrees with it.

**Block 2 — Title:**

Questions do not extend your deadline

**Block 2 — Text:**

The correction deadline on your notice still applies while you are asking about it, unless the investigator tells you otherwise.

### What to Do — \`what_to_do\` [TYPE] — page not approved

_The mockup heading "What to do" is not typed anywhere — Karl's What to Do panel carries its own label. Each step below becomes one Section block._

