1. Choose page: "Report cockroaches or other insects" (\`insectsReport\` → /sf.gov/report-cockroaches-or-other-insects)
2. Choose page: "Free IPM education workshop" (\`ipmEducation\` → /sf.gov/integrated-pest-management-education)
